One shareable URL with the full identity: headshot, role, email, GitHub,
LinkedIn, and the three-domain Grimaldi Network, rendered in the visitor's
locale (EN/ES/DE/ZH, compiler-enforced). /card.vcf stores the contact with
every profile in one tap; /card/qr is generated by the site itself so it can
never go stale. ProfilePage + Person JSON-LD with image and sameAs across
the whole network for search and AI-agent entity resolution; canonical,
OG profile type, sitemap entry; linked from the utility bar and footer.
vCard and QR ship noindex with canonical Link to /card so the HTML page
keeps the ranking signal.
